  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "WELCOME 2 THE"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "FUNKIEST BOOKSTORE IN THE UNIVERSE!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Join Our Komet Book Club Waitlist"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Privacy Policy"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Effective Date:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "December 02, 2024"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Welcome to Kane\u2019s Bookstore! Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit our website, located at www.kanesbookstore.com."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "By using our website, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Information We Collect"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. Personal Information"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- When you join the Komet Book Club, make purchases, or contact us, we may collect your:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Name"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Email address"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Phone number"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Shipping and billing address"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Non-Personal Information"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- We may collect non-personal information, such as browser type, IP address, and browsing activity, to improve your experience on our website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### How We Use Your Information"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "We use your information to:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Process purchases and ship products."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Send updates about the Komet Book Club, new arrivals, promotions, and events."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Respond to inquiries submitted via our contact form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Improve our website and ensure a secure shopping experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### How We Protect Your Information"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal information. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Sharing Your Information"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties, except as necessary to:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Fulfill your orders (e.g., shipping providers)."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Comply with legal obligations."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Protect our rights and property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Cookies and Tracking Technologies"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your browsing experience. Cookies help us understand how you interact with our website and improve functionality. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, but some features may not work properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Your Rights"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "You have the right to:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Access and update your personal information."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Opt-out of email communications by clicking the \u201cunsubscribe\u201d link in our emails."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "- Opt-out of text messages by replying \u201cSTOP\u201d to any message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "To exercise these rights, please contact us at [email protected]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Third-Party Links"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Our website may contain links to external websites, such as payment processors or social media platforms. We are not responsible for their privacy practices. Please review their policies before providing personal information."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Children\u2019s Privacy"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Our website is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we learn that we have, we will delete it promptly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Contact Us"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Kane\u2019s Bookstore"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Email: [email protected]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Phone: +1 470-775-0910"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Address: Austell, GA, USA"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Changes to This Privacy Policy"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with the updated effective date."
    },
